<id/17/1703/#concept> a <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E55_Type>, skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Orchelia"@en ;
    skos:broader <id/grp/grp_natural_dyestuffs/#concept> ;
    skos:editorialNote "Curated classification (group=grp_natural_dyestuffs): Named dye or pigment (annotto, orchella, weld, rock moss = orchil lichen per Mortimer 1823 s.v. ROCK MOSS 'See ORCHILLA', vermilion, zaffre, verdigris, lampblack) left in the residual bin. Layer-1 observations: 6 rows, 1800–1800. Series: KEW_CUST 5 ×6. Units: CWTS (Hundredweights) ×6. Top routes: World → United Kingdom ×1; Gibraltar → United Kingdom ×1; Spain and Canaries → United Kingdom ×1; Portugal and Madeira → United Kingdom ×1."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <id/scheme/#resource> ;
    skos:notation "1703" ;
